{"title":"Career Roadmap: Industrial & Production Engineering → Supply Chain Analyst","role":"Supply Chain Analyst","summary":"A Supply Chain Analyst uses engineering, operations, statistics and data analytics to improve the movement of materials, products and information across the supply chain.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Industrial & Production Engineering"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Domain","text":"Supply Chain, Operations, Procurement & Analytics"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Supply Chain Analyst uses engineering, operations, statistics and data analytics to improve the movement of materials, products and information across the supply chain."},{"type":"p","text":"The role typically involves:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Demand and supply analysis"},{"text":"Inventory optimization"},{"text":"Procurement analysis"},{"text":"Production planning"},{"text":"Logistics analysis"},{"text":"Warehouse performance analysis"},{"text":"Supplier performance monitoring"},{"text":"Cost analysis"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Supply chain dashboards"},{"text":"Identifying bottlenecks and inefficiencies"},{"text":"Supporting S&OP and operational decision-making"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For an Industrial & Production Engineering graduate, this is a strong career direction because the degree already provides exposure to operations research, production systems, quality, manufacturing, optimization and process improvement."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career Stage","Typical Role Direction","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1–2"},{"text":"Engineering Student"},{"text":"Mathematics, statistics, manufacturing and analytical fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2–3"},{"text":"Supply Chain / Operations Intern"},{"text":"Inventory, procurement, logistics and production data"}],[{"text":"Year 3–4"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analyst Intern / Trainee"},{"text":"Analytics, forecasting, dashboards and optimization"}],[{"text":"0–2 Years"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analyst"},{"text":"Reporting, forecasting, inventory and operational analysis"}],[{"text":"2–5 Years"},{"text":"Senior Supply Chain Analyst"},{"text":"Advanced analytics, optimization and planning"}],[{"text":"5–8 Years"},{"text":"Supply Chain Planning / Operations Manager"},{"text":"Planning, strategy and cross-functional management"}],[{"text":"8–12+ Years"},{"text":"Supply Chain Manager / Supply Chain Analytics Lead"},{"text":"Network optimization, strategy and leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Development Plan","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Engineering & Analytical Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong foundations in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mathematics"},{"text":"Engineering physics"},{"text":"Basic programming"},{"text":"Engineering drawing"},{"text":"Manufacturing fundamentals"},{"text":"Basic economics"},{"text":"Statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Start Learning"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Formulas"},{"text":"IF / IFS"},{"text":"SUMIFS / COUNTIFS"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX-MATCH"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Power Query"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Python","NumPy","Pandas","Matplotlib","Data Analysis"]},{"type":"h","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean"},{"text":"Median"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Standard deviation"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Distributions"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Industrial Engineering + Supply Chain Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a strong understanding of how businesses manufacture and distribute products."},{"type":"h","text":"Core Industrial Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Production planning"},{"text":"Operations research"},{"text":"Work study"},{"text":"Time study"},{"text":"Facility planning"},{"text":"Productivity analysis"},{"text":"Quality management"},{"text":"Lean manufacturing"},{"text":"Six Sigma fundamentals"},{"text":"Operations management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Supply Chain Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supplier","Procurement","Inbound Logistics","Raw Material Inventory","Production","Finished Goods","Warehouse","Distribution","Customer"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Inventory management"},{"text":"Warehousing"},{"text":"Transportation"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Distribution"},{"text":"Supplier management"},{"text":"Demand planning"},{"text":"Supply planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Supply Chain Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the most important development stage."},{"type":"h","text":"Demand Forecasting"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Moving averages"},{"text":"Weighted moving averages"},{"text":"Exponential smoothing"},{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Seasonality"},{"text":"Forecast accuracy"},{"text":"Forecast error"},{"text":"MAPE"},{"text":"RMSE"},{"text":"Bias"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Historical Sales","Data Cleaning","Trend + Seasonality Analysis","Forecast Model","Demand Forecast","Inventory Planning","Procurement / Production Decision"]},{"type":"h","text":"Inventory Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ABC analysis"},{"text":"XYZ analysis"},{"text":"Safety stock"},{"text":"Reorder point"},{"text":"Economic Order Quantity"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Service level"},{"text":"Inventory turnover"},{"text":"Stock-out analysis"},{"text":"Excess inventory"},{"text":"Slow-moving inventory"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Basic reorder point:"},{"type":"h","text":"Reorder Point = Demand During Lead Time + Safety Stock"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4 — Advanced Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Aggregations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Supply chain analysts frequently work with large operational databases, so SQL should become a core skill rather than an optional skill."},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data modeling"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"DAX"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"Measures"},{"text":"KPI cards"},{"text":"Drill-through"},{"text":"Interactive dashboards"},{"text":"Supply chain reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example dashboard:"},{"type":"p","text":"SUPPLY CHAIN DASHBOARD"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"┌───────────────┼───────────────┐"},{"type":"p","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"p","text":"Inventory Suppliers Logistics"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"p","text":"Stock Level OTIF % Delivery Time"},{"type":"p","text":"Turnover Lead Time Freight Cost"},{"type":"p","text":"Stock-outs Quality Delay Rate"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"flow","items":["└───────────────┼───────────────┘","Management Action"]}]},{"heading":"Production Planning Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Industrial & Production Engineering students should develop stronger production knowledge than a general business analytics graduate."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Master Production Schedule"},{"text":"Material Requirements Planning"},{"text":"Capacity planning"},{"text":"Production scheduling"},{"text":"Bill of Materials"},{"text":"Lead-time management"},{"text":"Resource planning"},{"text":"Production bottleneck analysis"},{"text":"Shop-floor productivity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the relationship:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Demand Forecast","Production Plan","Material Requirements","Procurement","Production","Inventory","Distribution"]}]},{"heading":"ERP Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"ERP exposure can significantly improve employability."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SAP"},{"text":"Oracle ERP"},{"text":"Microsoft Dynamics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For SAP-oriented roles, understand concepts around:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MM — Materials Management"},{"text":"PP — Production Planning"},{"text":"SD — Sales & Distribution"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A student does not need to master every ERP module."},{"type":"p","text":"For a Supply Chain Analyst, the stronger combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supply Chain","Excel","SQL","Power BI","ERP fundamentals."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Core Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Graduation Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Industrial Engineering"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Operations Management"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Inventory Management"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Demand Forecasting"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Procurement Analytics"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Logistics Analytics"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Production Planning"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Operations Research"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Data Visualization"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"ERP Fundamentals"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"SAP Concepts"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Lean Manufacturing"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Six Sigma"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Cost Analysis"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Supplier Performance"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Business Presentation"},{"text":"Advanced"}]]}]},{"heading":"Practical Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Projects should demonstrate business decision-making, not just dashboards."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Inventory Optimization System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a system that analyzes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SKU demand"},{"text":"Current inventory"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Safety stock"},{"text":"Reorder point"},{"text":"Stock-outs"},{"text":"Excess inventory"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Output:"},{"type":"flow","items":["SKU","Demand Analysis","ABC Classification","Lead-Time Analysis","Safety Stock","Reorder Point","Inventory Recommendation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Demand Forecasting System"},{"type":"p","text":"Use historical sales data to forecast future demand."},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Pandas"},{"text":"Matplotlib"},{"text":"Scikit-learn"},{"text":"Excel / Power BI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Output"},{"type":"flow","items":["Historical Demand","Data Cleaning","EDA","Forecast Model","Future Demand","Forecast Accuracy"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Supply Chain Performance Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Power BI dashboard covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Inventory turnover"},{"text":"Stock-out rate"},{"text":"Supplier OTIF"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Purchase cost"},{"text":"Order fulfillment"},{"text":"Delivery performance"},{"text":"Warehouse utilization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Supplier Performance Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a supplier scorecard."},{"type":"p","text":"Evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Price"},{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"Delivery"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Defect rate"},{"text":"On-time delivery"},{"text":"Order fulfillment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supplier Data","Quality Score"]},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Delivery Score"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Cost Score"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reliability Score","Supplier Performance Score","Supplier Ranking"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Production & Inventory Optimization"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Demand","Production","Inventory","Procurement"]},{"type":"p","text":"Use operations research techniques to determine an optimized production plan under constraints such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Capacity"},{"text":"Labor"},{"text":"Material availability"},{"text":"Demand"},{"text":"Inventory limits"},{"text":"Production costs"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target internships during Year 3 and Year 4 in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Primary Targets"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supply Chain Intern"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Operations Intern"},{"text":"Procurement Intern"},{"text":"Logistics Intern"},{"text":"Demand Planning Intern"},{"text":"Inventory Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Production Planning Intern"},{"text":"Operations Research Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Secondary Targets"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Data Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Manufacturing Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Process Improvement Intern"},{"text":"Quality Analyst Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Work to Prioritize"},{"type":"p","text":"Try to obtain experience with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Inventory reports"},{"text":"Purchase orders"},{"text":"Supplier performance"},{"text":"Demand forecasting"},{"text":"Production planning"},{"text":"Logistics tracking"},{"text":"Excel reporting"},{"text":"Power BI dashboards"},{"text":"ERP systems"},{"text":"Process improvement"}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After B.Tech, possible positions include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supply Chain Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Supply Chain Analyst"},{"text":"Supply Chain Executive"},{"text":"Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Logistics Analyst"},{"text":"Inventory Analyst"},{"text":"Procurement Analyst"},{"text":"Demand Planning Analyst"},{"text":"Production Planning Analyst"},{"text":"Materials Analyst"},{"text":"Procurement Executive"},{"text":"Logistics Executive"},{"text":"Operations Executive"},{"text":"Business Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Manufacturing Analyst"},{"text":"Process Improvement Analyst"},{"text":"Supply Planning Analyst"},{"text":"Warehouse Analyst"},{"text":"Supplier Performance Analyst"},{"text":"Supply Chain Data Analyst"}]}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer Requirement","Importance"],"rows":[[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Supply Chain Fundamentals"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Inventory Management"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Demand Forecasting"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Production Planning"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"ERP/SAP"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Operations Research"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Lean/Six Sigma"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Problem Solving"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful certification directions include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Supply Chain"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"Inventory Management"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Logistics Management"},{"text":"Demand Planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python for Data Analysis"},{"text":"Business Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Operations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lean Management"},{"text":"Six Sigma"},{"text":"Operations Research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"ERP"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SAP fundamentals"},{"text":"SAP MM"},{"text":"SAP PP"},{"text":"Other ERP supply-chain modules"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certifications should support practical skills; they should not replace projects or internship experience."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After B.Tech, relevant options include:"},{"type":"p","text":"M.Tech / M.E."},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Industrial Engineering"},{"text":"Production Engineering"},{"text":"Manufacturing Engineering"},{"text":"Operations Research"},{"text":"Industrial Engineering & Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA"},{"type":"p","text":"Strong options include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"MBA Operations Management"},{"text":"MBA Logistics"},{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"text":"MBA Operations & Supply Chain"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialized Master's"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supply Chain Analytics"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Operations Research"},{"text":"Logistics & Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"Industrial Engineering"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For someone targeting management and strategic supply-chain positions, MBA Operations/Supply Chain + engineering background can be particularly useful."}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After gaining experience, the candidate can specialize in:"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Demand Planning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Historical Demand","Forecasting","Demand Plan","Supply Alignment"]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Inventory Optimization"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Safety stock"},{"text":"Reorder points"},{"text":"Service levels"},{"text":"Inventory reduction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Procurement Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supplier performance"},{"text":"Spend analytics"},{"text":"Cost optimization"},{"text":"Vendor selection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Logistics Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transportation"},{"text":"Delivery performance"},{"text":"Route optimization"},{"text":"Freight costs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Supply Chain Data Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"Optimization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Supply Chain Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"S&OP"},{"text":"Production planning"},{"text":"Capacity planning"},{"text":"Material planning"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Path A — Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supply Chain Analyst","Senior Supply Chain Analyst","Supply Chain Analytics Lead","Supply Chain Analytics Manager","Supply Chain Analytics Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"Path B — Planning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supply Chain Analyst","Demand / Supply Planner","Senior Planner","Planning Manager","Head of Planning"]},{"type":"h","text":"Path C — Operations"},{"type":"flow","items":["Operations Analyst","Operations Manager","Supply Chain Manager","Regional Supply Chain Manager","Supply Chain Director"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The supply-chain analyst of the future will increasingly work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI demand forecasting"},{"text":"Machine-learning inventory optimization"},{"text":"Generative AI for supply-chain reporting"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"IoT inventory tracking"},{"text":"Real-time logistics analytics"},{"text":"Predictive maintenance"},{"text":"Computer vision in warehouses"},{"text":"Automated procurement"},{"text":"Autonomous warehouses"},{"text":"Robotics"},{"text":"Route optimization"},{"text":"Supply-chain simulation"},{"text":"Control towers"},{"text":"Advanced planning systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The important point is that AI should complement supply-chain knowledge rather than replace it."},{"type":"p","text":"A student who knows only Python/AI but doesn't understand inventory, procurement, production and logistics will be weaker for this specific career than someone who combines both."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Industrial & Production Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Supply Chain Management"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Operations Research"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Inventory & Demand Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"ERP / SAP"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Lean / Six Sigma"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Communication","SUPPLY CHAIN ANALYST"]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to take a real supply-chain problem and move through:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Problem","Data Collection","Data Cleaning","Exploratory Analysis","Supply Chain KPI Analysis","Forecast / Optimization","Business Recommendation","Power BI / Management Report","Operational Decision"]},{"type":"h","text":"Minimum portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"The graduate should ideally have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"2 supply-chain analytics projects"},{"text":"1 demand forecasting project"},{"text":"1 inventory optimization project"},{"text":"1 Power BI dashboard"},{"text":"SQL portfolio"},{"text":"Advanced Excel skills"},{"text":"Python analytics project"},{"text":"ERP/SAP fundamentals"},{"text":"At least one relevant internship"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning for Industrial & Production Engineering → Supply Chain Analyst is not simply:"},{"type":"h","text":"“Engineering graduate who knows analytics.”"},{"type":"p","text":"It should be:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Industrial engineering graduate who understands production and operations and can use Excel, SQL, Power BI, Python, forecasting and optimization to solve supply-chain problems.”"},{"type":"p","text":"That combination creates a strong bridge between engineering operations and data-driven supply-chain decision-making."},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech Industrial & Production Engineering","Supply Chain/Operations Internship","Supply Chain Analyst","Senior Supply Chain Analyst","Supply Chain Planning/Analytics Lead","Supply Chain Manager / Analytics Manager"]}]}]}